          "id": "D-006",
          "title": "PAUSED by owner 2026-08-14: webapp first, mobile later",
          "body": "Date: 2026-08-14\n[owner:Avi 2026-08-14 ~03:45Z verbatim: paude the work on the android and iphone app, lets focus on the webapp first, we can pickup the iphone nad android app later] All lanes on this plan are PAUSED: holders were stood down with resumable checkpoints (WI-38612 android / WI-38622 iOS), items released with reason owner-paused. Do NOT claim or resume items on this plan until the owner re-opens mobile work.",
