      "markdown": "---\ntitle: SideStage architecture page and complete system documentation\nslug: sidestage-architecture-page-2026-08-15\nstatus: ready\ncreated: 2026-08-15\nupdated: 2026-08-15\n---\n\n# SideStage architecture page and complete system documentation\n\n## Now\n\n**State:** Draft. Plan body to be filled in.\n\n**Next:** human reviews scope and lists Phase 1 items.\n\n## Background\n\n(Why this plan exists; what problem it addresses.)\n\n## Phase 1 — TODO\n\n(Use plans:add-item to populate. Each item is one line:\nsingle id, status token, free text, optional blocked-by.)\n\n\n## Phase — Implementation\n\n- **P-001** `done` Audit the SideStage webapp structure, runtime boundaries, data flows, infrastructure, and existing documentation so every architecture claim is source-backed. importance: high — note: ← WI-39227 completed (done)\n- **P-002** `done` Specify the Architecture page using existing SideStage navigation and visual primitives, with responsive diagrams covering system context, frontend, backend, data, realtime/media, AI/Scout, payments, testing, deployment, and security. blocked-by: P-001 importance: high — note: ← WI-39228 completed (done)\n- **P-003** `done` Implement the new Architecture navbar item immediately after Tests, the routed page, diagram components/styles, and focused regression tests. blocked-by: P-002 importance: high — note: ← WI-39229 completed (done)\n- **P-004** `done` Run focused tests, type/build checks, and Verdict browser verification at mobile and desktop widths; correct any coverage or presentation gaps. blocked-by: P-003 importance: high — note: ← WI-39235 completed (done)\n\n\n\n\n## Decisions\n\n(Use plans:add-decision to append. Each decision is a third-level\nheading with a date line and a body paragraph.)\n",
