          "id": "D-001",
          "title": "A mid-deploy release trace does not clear D-010 without live-process proof",
          "body": "Date: 2026-08-15\nKeep D-010/P-001 closed. release:trace generatedAtMs 1786780624945 observed green pin/deploy-checkout parity while the safe deploy was still in flight. The deploy subsequently failed pre-cutover because papercup-release/node_modules/@papercusp/sse/dist/index.js was missing, rolled back, and :3070 remained on 962664ae. Clearance requires a fresh post-deploy read proving the actual serving process SHA equals exact tested/green 1feac8dd, followed by the launcher partial-canary behavior proof. Critical deploy blocker: EI-20505072457524017; parent launcher item: EI-20497372063255974.\nRelated: P-001",
