          "text": "Provision SideStage zero-cache for local, staging, and production by reusing Restart's proven operational pattern: direct Postgres logical replication; a deliberately scoped publication matching the SideStage Zero schema exactly; separate upstream/change DB settings; query/mutate URLs; least-privilege app-role grants to Zero metadata; client/server @rocicorp/zero version pinning; persistent per-instance replica and unique replication slot; TLS WebSocket routing and sticky sessions; keepalive health checks; startup replica-lock recovery; replication-lag, reconnect, heap/disk, and publication-drift alerts; and a tested re-replication/rollback procedure for published schema changes.   — note: ← WI-39155 released",
