          "title": "D-010 atomic boundary: finish the in-flight WI-38645 web half, then freeze",
          "body": "Date: 2026-08-15\nAt 2026-08-15T05:53Z the WI-38645 web half had already acquired its six file locks and produced dirty files, so that web half is the current atomic boundary. WI-38645 must finish only that full feature atom, run its required verification, publish it through git-sync, complete/checkpoint the item, release every SideStage lock, and explicitly enter the no-write/no-deploy hold. The earlier stop-after-server instruction is superseded because stopping now would strand a half-written cross-layer feature. WI-39225 and every other lane remain no-write/no-deploy and must not add unrelated SideStage work; they may resume public verification only after the stable remote-matched candidate is established. The P-009 release owner will not snapshot, check/build, deploy, or emit generation 2 until this atom and all newer blockers are terminal.\nRelated: P-009",
