          "id": "D-016",
          "title": "Restart D-010 snapshot after owner-directed WI-39240 repair; retain already-green 31f2e207",
          "body": "Date: 2026-08-15\nD-015's no-write boundary is superseded for release-candidate purposes. The owner-directed WI-39240 code correction explicitly reopened SideStage writes, so no generation-2 snapshot may rely on D-015. Commit 31f2e207 remains in the next candidate: it was already inside the remote staging ancestry and its focused catalog regression plus API typecheck were green; serializing a revert would add risk without restoring a valid freeze. After WI-39240, WI-38645, and all other declared repair lanes are terminal, the WI-39007 owner must run a fresh D-010 writer/lock census, establish a new no-write hold, and only then perform exact check/build/deploy/public proof and emit generation 2.\nRelated: P-009",
