          "id": "D-018",
          "title": "SideStage release-gate timeouts require writer and owner verification",
          "body": "Date: 2026-08-15\nThe verified-timeout producer-health result for await 57394 is not authoritative for this bespoke release-snapshot gate: it attributed Papercusp candidate 1feac8dd to pipeline=sidestage and falsely classified the live, progressing release owner as stalled. Until EI-20504666364885425 is fixed, timeout handling must read the exact event generation, harness_shared.pipeline_events for install_slug=sidestage, the public /healthz SHA, and exact release-owner liveness/checkpoint. A timeout alone does not justify takeover. Studio replay eligibility remains generation 2 state=fired with actual_sha exactly equal to the fresh public health SHA.\nRelated: P-004, P-009",
