          "id": "D-020",
          "title": "Ignore cross-scope producer-health candidate substitutions; authoritative candidate is pipeline_events.detail.candidate",
          "body": "Date: 2026-08-15\n2026-08-15 D-010 monitor ruling. A timeout for the exact SideStage release-snapshot gate was registered against candidate b4053dafdd3a but returned a verified-wait producer candidate 68ac9f0bdef3 and wake-owner-or-takeover. Fresh scoped writer evidence proves 68ac is only SideStage row 184304 detail.vintage.treeSha; the row's actual detail.candidate remains b4053dafdd3a. The 68ac SHA is the Papercusp repair-bearing runtime/checkpoint tip, not the SideStage release candidate. Therefore no lane may wake, displace, or take over WI-39007/EI-205093 from that classifier output alone. Re-read scoped pipeline_events.detail.candidate, exact work-item progress, and owner liveness. File EI-20514492183931816 tracks the classifier defect. D-010 remains closed until generation 2 fires and its actual_sha equals a fresh public /healthz SHA.",
