          "id": "D-021",
          "title": "Serialize the shared avi-real-test production fixture under d53",
          "body": "Date: 2026-08-15\nAt 2026-08-15 13:10 EDT, fresh ledger evidence showed EI-204854 and EI-204965 concurrently mutating the same public avi-real-test fixture on exact SideStage 075ecc. Effective immediately, su-d53df154-b124-4dda-8bd7-f1b1cd3352b1 is the sole continuation owner for public fixture mutations. It must inspect and preserve the partial event/config already created by EI-204965, must not recreate or overwrite it when present, and continues the owned seller-JHGLDS plus exact Harbor Kettle Copilot proof. su-701bd7ac-1d5c-4b66-a0ec-c8804c422b2f freezes public mutations, checkpoints the existing event/config and inventory-hold 404 request/response, hands those details to d53, and later terminalizes EI-204965 from the shared proof without repeating setup. Generation 2 remains held until both residues are terminal and exact public 075ecc is independently re-proven. Coordination ruling: msumt2e0-0000-62ecc912b99a46d589e1bbd7434c0346; collision report: msums2a0-0000-22f0cb2e44cf4c288eaff3b340062737.\nRelated: P-009",
