          "id": "D-022",
          "title": "Serialize D-017 public fixture mutation to EI-204854",
          "body": "Date: 2026-08-15\nAs of 2026-08-15 17:10Z, su-d53df154-b124-4dda-8bd7-f1b1cd3352b1 / EI-20485490544986949 is the sole owner authorized to mutate the exact public 075ecc avi-real-test fixture. EI-20496543498783917 / su-701bd freezes all further production-data mutation and hands off its partial state: seller seller-JHGLDS, event avi-real-test published, seller-scoped inventory hold returned 404 before any item attachment. The sole owner must inspect/reuse the existing event rather than recreate it and deliver terminal proof or a diagnosed blocker to WI-39007.",
