          "id": "D-027",
          "title": "Authorize one exact 5f4c1b5b3276 deploy for the P-024 release-drive full-green step (heartbeat-404 fix + cart regression test)",
          "body": "Date: 2026-08-16\nDate: 2026-08-16. D-026's one c8eaf164 deployment is spent (current prod). The release drive (sidestage-public-release-drive-2026-08-16, P-024/WI-39463, protocol recorded there as D-004) requires prod to pick up 7eb424f (heartbeat-404 loop fix, EI-20589266065184157) and the new cart regression test. Exact candidate: local sidestage staging HEAD 5f4c1b5b3276a721256660ce4e613cf14d1b7e36 — verified by executor su-3467b37d (merge-base ancestry: contains 7eb424f + cart.controller.test.ts) and independently corroborated by leader su-66132 (tree read: branch staging, 0 dirty, HEAD = pin; 7eb424f is-ancestor YES; cart test committed c5a0fd6). Fresh authoritative SideStage-native clean-green verdict bound exactly to this pin: pipeline event 193962 (2026-08-16T14:17:13Z), kind=green_checkpoint, status=advanced, green=true, cleanGreen=true, runId=82bcb06c-0bda-45c8-b905-400c7925ba39, main advanced 6da2c01d8454→5f4c1b5b3276; the subsequent event 194338 (15:15Z, up-to-date, candidate=pin) confirms no newer candidate supersedes it. AUTHORIZE exactly one serialized SideStage production deploy of main=5f4c1b5b3276a721256660ce4e613cf14d1b7e36 after a dry-run/free-lock/exact-main preflight; never deploy a newer unverified local tip. After deployment: publicly verify health SHA = pin, then the post-deploy zero-console re-verify through buyer+seller loops per sidestage-public-release-drive-2026-08-16#D-003. Terminalize WI-39463 only from that evidence. Red or ambiguity must be fixed and rerun, never forced. This decision is SPENT once the deploy executes, succeed or roll back — a successor deploy needs a fresh decision. PUBLIC_HOSTNAME / WI-39411 (DNS) remains owner-walled and untouched by this authorization.",
