      "markdown": "---\ntitle: Audit and reconcile every blocked SideStage plan and work item\nslug: sidestage-blocked-items-audit-2026-08-15\nstatus: ready\ncreated: 2026-08-15\nupdated: 2026-08-15\n---\n\n## Now\n\n**State:** Approved for execution via route A.\n\n**Next:** Inventory every effective plan block and blocked/held work-item, then reconcile stale state safely.\n\n## Background\n\nSideStage currently has 61 non-archived plans and an initial census of 16 work-items stored as blocked. This audit must distinguish valid dependencies from stale plan/work-item state, temporary claim holds, external blockers, and needs-human gates; clear only demonstrably invalid blocks; and preserve live peer work.\n\n\n## Phase 1 — Full block audit and reconciliation\n\n- **P-001** `done` Inventory every non-archived SideStage plan item plus every blocked, held, needs-human, and externally blocked work-item; record the complete cohort. importance: high — note: ← WI-39231 completed (done)\n- **P-002** `done` Trace every candidate block to its writer, dependency graph, current plan Decisions, holder liveness, checkpoint, and external capability; classify valid versus stale or contradictory. blocked-by: P-001 importance: high — note: ← WI-39253 completed (done)\n- **P-003** `done` Clear every demonstrably invalid block or stale temporary hold without disturbing live peer work, and record the exact evidence for each mutation. blocked-by: P-002 importance: high — note: ← WI-39270 completed (done)\n- **P-004** `done` Re-read all SideStage plans and work-items, verify convergence, and deliver a full residue report naming each remaining block and the exact requirement to clear it. blocked-by: P-003 importance: high — note: ← WI-39271 completed (done)\n\n\n\n",
