          "body": "Date: 2026-08-13\n[owner:Avi 2026-08-13, verbatim] \"1. do scripts/export-restart-catalog.sh now 2. implement the sidestage-code-quality-2026-08-13 plan yourself now from start to finish on auto mode.\"\n\nRulings: (1) The plan is APPROVED as registered — all 7 items, P-101..P-107, in the registered order. (2) Execution route: the leader (su-c18bab18) implements solo under AUTO — no fleet dispatch (fleet is paused per the owner's earlier directive). (3) scripts/export-restart-catalog.sh runs FIRST, so P-102's catalog read-model serves the real Restart catalog rather than only the 8-row demo seed. Public-repo hygiene still applies: the exported production data must NOT be committed to the public sidestage repo (the seed stays the committed fixture; the export lands in the local DB / a gitignored path only).",
