          "body": "Date: 2026-08-13\n[owner:Avi 2026-08-13 \"is part of the plan to adopt our grid libraries everywhere grids are used because I dont see those adopted yet\"] Ruling: (1) P-112's completion bar is ALL data-grid components on libs/papergrid (RichGrid family) — a completion covering only BuyerProductRail + InventoryPickerGrid must name every remaining hand-rolled grid as explicit residue with an owner (item or lane), never silently drop it. (2) EventManager.tsx — the grid Avi actually sees in the Seller tab today — is demo-state code being REPLACED by P-108's real event setup/management surface; that replacement (and any queue/lineup/picker rendering P-108 builds) uses papergrid components from the start, so the visible Seller-tab grid gap closes via P-108, not by converting throwaway demo code. (3) Current verified adoption state 20:07Z: libs vendored (papergrid/ui-primitives/sync present in tree); 2 components converted; ONLY BuyerProductRail is visible in the running app (BuyerTab.tsx:209) — InventoryPickerGrid is wired into EventCreationPanel which is NOT yet mounted anywhere (mounts with P-108). This is why adoption is not yet visible in the app.",
