          "kind": "work-item",
          "title": "Fix duplicate React in the committed lockfile (tracked as WI-38708): libs/papergrid/node_modules/react@18.3.1 vs root react@19.2.8 — full root-level `npx vitest run apps/web` crosses the copies (useSyncExternalStore null, 8 files/19 tests red). Fix per dockview D-017: root-cause the papergrid react pin (hard dependency where a peerDependency belongs), align to one root React, re-dedupe via `npm run install:safe` only — never hand-edit package-lock.json. NOT gate-blocking (dockview D-016). Verification = those 8 apps/web files green on a full root-level run.",
