          "body": "Date: 2026-08-15\nP-008 through P-012 run against production under the current D-010 freeze. Each unrelated browser flow must use a fresh VERDICT_DATA_DIR and preserve artifacts under /tmp. Testers may exercise only navigation, local UI state, validation that does not submit, responsive/keyboard behavior, reload, and read-only network/source inspection. They must not Create, Schedule, Start, Add inventory, Save, Run preflight, Prepare, Approve, Skip, or otherwise mutate SideStage data. Each lane checkpoints exact elements/routes/viewports plus console/network evidence and files one deduplicated work-item per confirmed defect.\nRelated: P-008, P-009, P-010, P-011, P-012",
          "date": "2026-08-15",
          "itemRefs": [
            "P-008",
            "P-012",
            "P-009",
            "P-010",
            "P-011"
          ],
          "lineNumber": 50
