      "markdown": "---\ntitle: Implement the selected Queue + inspector Copilot layout\nslug: sidestage-copilot-queue-inspector-implementation-2026-08-15\nstatus: ready\ncreated: 2026-08-15\nupdated: 2026-08-15\n---\n\n# Implement the selected Queue + inspector Copilot layout\n\n## Now\n\n**State:** Draft. Plan body to be filled in.\n\n**Next:** human reviews scope and lists Phase 1 items.\n\n## Background\n\n(Why this plan exists; what problem it addresses.)\n\n## Phase 1 — TODO\n\n(Use plans:add-item to populate. Each item is one line:\nsingle id, status token, free text, optional blocked-by.)\n\n\n## Phase — Implementation\n\n- **P-001** `done` Refactor CopilotPanel into a selectable queue rail and focused review inspector, add responsive fallback styling, and add focused component/integration regression coverage. importance: high — note: ← WI-39234 completed (done)\n- **P-002** `done` Verify the selected layout through targeted tests, typecheck/build, and the real SideStage browser runtime; resolve any regressions and close the plan with evidence. blocked-by: P-001 importance: high — note: ← WI-39242 completed (done)\n\n\n## Decisions\n\n(Use plans:add-decision to append. Each decision is a third-level\nheading with a date line and a body paragraph.)\n\n### D-001 — Use mockup direction 2 as implementation authority\nDate: 2026-08-15\nThe owner explicitly selected Queue + inspector. Preserve all existing Copilot proposal data, mutations, evidence, guarded actions, and seller controls; change only presentation and local selection state. The queue must remain usable at narrow dock widths via a stacked/horizontal fallback.\n",
