      "markdown": "---\ntitle: SideStage event manager and curated 200-variant catalog\nslug: sidestage-event-manager-catalog-200-variants-2026-08-14\nstatus: shipped\ncreated: 2026-08-14\nupdated: 2026-08-14\n---\n\n# SideStage event manager and curated 200-variant catalog\n\n## Now\n\n**State:** ⛔ PLAN CLOSED — SHIPPED 2026-08-14. Nothing in this plan is actionable. Anything below this line is the last pre-shipped snapshot, kept for history: it described work that is finished or abandoned, so do not start from it. Read frontmatter `status`, not this prose, to learn whether a plan is live (stamped by plans:set-plan-status).\n\nDraft. Plan body to be filled in.\n\n**Next:** none — the plan is shipped. (Pre-shipped next, no longer actionable: human reviews scope and lists Phase 1 items.)\n\n## Background\n\n(Why this plan exists; what problem it addresses.)\n\n## Phase 1 — TODO\n\n(Use plans:add-item to populate. Each item is one line:\nsingle id, status token, free text, optional blocked-by.)\n\n\n## Phase — Implementation\n\n- **P-001** `done` Fix selected event row color parsing so CSS Color 4 channel scales retain intended contrast; add regression coverage. importance: high — note: ← WI-38839 completed (done)\n- **P-002** `done` Curate exactly 200 demo catalog variants in the existing catalog/option tables across color-only, size-only, and color-plus-size products; extend query/model coverage for color and size. importance: high — note: ← WI-38840 completed (done)\n- **P-003** `done` Move Create event into a compact sticky toolbar above the catalog and render color plus size variant metadata responsively. importance: high — note: ← WI-38841 completed (done)\n- **P-004** `done` Add focused API/component/data tests covering the 200-variant invariant, option normalization, selection contrast, sticky scroll behavior, and responsive layout. blocked-by: P-001, P-002, P-003 importance: high — note: ← WI-38842 completed (done)\n- **P-005** `done` Run focused and full verification plus desktop and mobile SideStage QA, record evidence, and close the plan. blocked-by: P-004 importance: high — note: ← WI-38843 completed (done)\n\n\n\n\n\n## Decisions\n\n(Use plans:add-decision to append. Each decision is a third-level\nheading with a date line and a body paragraph.)\n\n### D-001 — Approved scope and execution route\nDate: 2026-08-14\nAvi approved AUTO self-execution from start to finish. Reuse the existing SideStage catalog and option tables; expose exactly 200 curated visible variants, support both normalized color and size metadata, fix the CSS Color 4 parser at its channel-scaling root, place Create event in a compact sticky toolbar, and verify desktop plus mobile without spawning subagents.\nRelated: P-001, P-002, P-003, P-004, P-005\n",
