          "body": "Date: 2026-08-15\nThis decision supersedes sidestage-studio-inventory-tab-2026-08-14#D-001 by owner direction. The editable Qty column represents authoritative total physical inventory, not an intake delta and not available-only stock. Save overwrites qty and selling price through the existing inventory authority. Reserved remains read-only; saves below reserved are rejected so active holds stay valid; available stock continues to derive from qty minus reserved.\nRelated: P-001, P-002",
