          "id": "D-031",
          "title": "Retraction: 19:08Z grade/shipped claim was invalid; independent grade still required",
          "body": "Date: 2026-08-14\nThe 19:08Z message from su-08298ddf claiming the iPhone acceptance grade was complete and the plan shipped was wrong. It conflated a scorecard-accepted message for plan sidestage-live-sync-contract-repair-2026-08-14 with this plan's later grading request. At correction time this plan remained ready and no scorecard existed. Treat the prior claim as withdrawn; the independent grader must run scorecards:evaluate and scorecards:emit against sidestage-iphone-app-acceptance before any shipped claim.\nRelated: P-001, P-002, P-003, P-004, P-005, P-006, P-007, P-008",
