          "title": "Execution route: headless fleet led by this su; members = ChatGPT 5.6 Luna at max effort — ON HOLD until implementation discussion",
          "body": "Date: 2026-08-13\n[owner:Avi 2026-08-13] Route = new HEADLESS fleet via fleet:launch-on-plan { headless:true }, this session as leader. Owner directive: \"launch a fleet of chatgpt 5.6 luna maxes\" — member model = GPT-5.6 Luna, effort max (exact model id to be verified against the gateway at spawn). Account + carry unstated → defaults (default system account, warm carry), to be announced at spawn per the spawn-announcement rule. ⚠ HOLD [owner:Avi 2026-08-13]: \"dont implement the plan or launch the fleet yet though, I want to discuss the implementation with you first\" — NO pot creation, NO fleet launch, NO build work until the owner closes the implementation discussion.",
