          "title": "Repo/app shape: new POT named 'sidestage', published publicly to GitHub under the papercusp account",
          "body": "Date: 2026-08-13\n[owner:Avi 2026-08-13] The app is created as a NEW POT (pot machinery owns the git setup — \"Making a new pot should automatically take care of the git part\"). Publish publicly to GitHub under the papercusp account, repo name 'sidestage'. Restart repo stays private; Restart code is ported in. Note carried from assessment: contest reviewers read full commit history — the pot's git plumbing must produce a history that reads as genuine incremental work; verify this property during the implementation discussion before pot creation.",
