          "id": "D-014",
          "title": "Canonical SideStage working tree = /home/marsh-office/.papercusp/hives/sidestage (pot home, origin github.com/Papercusp/sidestage); data compose integrates via include:, not mount-copying",
          "body": "Date: 2026-08-13\nALL SideStage implementation happens in the pot home tree /home/marsh-office/.papercusp/hives/sidestage (verified: origin=https://github.com/Papercusp/sidestage.git, git-sync auto-commits it — leave work in the tree, no manual git). NOT in the papercusp staging tree, NOT in /home/marsh-office/Restart (read-only source for ports). Compose: the root docker-compose.yml (P-001-owned per D-012) integrates P-002's isolated data compose via the compose `include:` directive after gate sidestage-skeleton-ready — do NOT copy mounts/services into the root file; judges must get single-command boot (docker compose up) on a clean clone. [self-imposed leader ruling 2026-08-13; path verified live by leader + f0104]",
