          "text": "P-024 (label): Prod redeploy + post-deploy console re-verify (final full-green evidence step, per D-003). (1) Re-verify campaign deploy-governance decision refs D-024/D-005 (and D-023's cleared externalBlocker) still permit a prod deploy. (2) Deploy current staging to sidestage prod via the same mechanism as the D-026-authorized c8eaf164 deploy — must pick up 7eb424f (EventChat heartbeat-404 fix, 12/12 tests) and the new cart regression test (apps/api/src/cart/cart.controller.test.ts); confirm git-sync committed both first. (3) Post-deploy: verify /healthz sha advanced to include 7eb424f and run the live console re-verify through full buyer+seller loops on prod — D-003 acceptance is ZERO console errors (heartbeat 404 loop gone; EI-20587893882016538 is cannot-reproduce, not a blocker). (4) Report evidence to leader su-66132 for the full-green re-grade. Do NOT flip PUBLIC_HOSTNAME (WI-39411 DNS wall is owner-gated, separate).  — note: ← WI-39463 completed (done)",
