          "title": "P-010 independent grade waits for every rubric lane and the fix loop",
          "body": "Date: 2026-08-14\nDate: 2026-08-14. At 15:14Z scheduler:get_next claimed P-010 even though P-001, P-002, P-005, P-006, P-008, and P-009 were nonterminal; P-010 had blockedBy:[] despite its own contract saying to grade after the campaign runs. Restored those six blocked-by edges and released WI-38802. Do not emit the release-readiness scorecard early: fix/re-run every criterion lane first, then the independent non-implementer grades all seven criteria once against current deployed evidence.",
