          "text": "Implement the approved compact sidebar-driven Test web-page workbench from reports/test.md, specs/test.ui-ir.json, and mockups/test.html in the production Test surface. Preserve rehearsal behavior, dense status rows, focused details/run pane, search/filter navigation, and add focused tests.   — note: ← WI-38788 completed (done)",
