          "body": "Date: 2026-08-17\nRuling for every docs lane (architecture page, TDD.md, submission.md, PRD.md): public-facing docs must not claim WebSocket sync while the live transport is SSE. Doc updates P-006/P-007/P-008 are blocked-by the actual cutover P-004. If Avi chooses a post-submission or canaried cutover, submission docs state truthfully: SSE live today, Zero WS transport built and staged (citing this plan). This protects challenge-submission integrity — reviewers execute the app and would catch an aspirational architecture claim. [self-imposed, derived from the submission-honesty requirement in docs/challenge-brief.md]\nRelated: P-004, P-006, P-007, P-008",
